let state={occasion:'morning',recipient:'',sender:'',mood:'warm',title:'',message:'',when:'',where:'',format:'square',style:'warm',bg:'flowers',motion:'zoom',effect:'none',photoFit:'cover',layout:'frame',duration:10,subtitle:true,sound:false,photoX:50,photoY:50,photoZoom:1};
